  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a80e7aaf-a864-4d1d-87b7-50ddf39fdc98.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">獨一無二的整合包！匯集所有最棒的殭屍末日模組！</span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>本整合包不僅匯集了最優秀的模組，更囊括了 Minecraft 中所有現有的殭屍末日主題模組&hellip; 總計超過 100 個模組，為您打造完整的遊戲體驗。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>全武器</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>超過 30 種殭屍</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>三合一地圖（將三款最佳殭屍地圖合併為一張）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>血月</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>真實感著色器（含末日霧效）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>殭屍陷阱&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感染與醫療包系統</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>裝飾方塊</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>還有更多&hellip;</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">安裝時請小心，此整合包極具「傳染性」！僅限有準備的玩家遊玩。</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VwZl8ldIWvQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">新殭屍！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131301/description_ce1952b6-8eca-4559-832c-6756d5bb922e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">新物品！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1131301/description_d5ec0640-78ff-4bb0-b624-81742f80358b.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
